{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Oh, you poor thing, you look done in, sit down, rest, rest a minute","Tired and hungry? same here, same exact thing, we're a pair, aren't we!","Here, sit, I wish I had a hot meal for you, I wish I had a bed","I know -- I know, it's awful, it's so awful, just breathe, we'll find something","You're going to be okay, you will, you're stronger than you think","Same, same, I haven't had a proper meal in days, I keep dreaming about food","Sit, rest, I'll see what I have, it's not much, but it's something","I've got half a granola bar, take it, I mean it, take it","Oh man, I feel that in my bones, rest, rest while you can"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"Let's find you a safe corner -- and a little food, and a lot of quiet"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=neutral",{"Rest when you can, eat when you can, that's the only advice I have","We're all tired, we're all hungry, you're not alone","Sorry, I wish I could help, I'm running low myself","Find some shade... find some water, find a place to sit, it'll help","Join the club, there's no cure but food and sleep"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"So? everybody's tired and hungry","Don't look at me, I've got nothing to give","Keep moving or lie down and die, I don't care which","Everybody's hungry, I'm not feeding strangers - keep moving"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly",{"Tired and hungry makes everything worse, get some water and a bite and sleep"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly",{"Come, share what little we have, there's always room at the table for one more"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","role=family_elder|st=friendly",{"Come sit, hon, I've got a few crackers and some tea, not much, but it's warm"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Tired and hungry? Join the club","Everyone's hungry, kid, eat dirt for all I care","Sleep when you're dead, that's what I say","Hunger makes you quick, or dead, take your pick","Not my problem, I'm starving too"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Hungry? Good, hunger makes you desperate, and desperate people make mistakes!"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Man, tell me about it, haven't slept in days, I'd eat a horse","Look, I've got some crackers in my pack, they're stale, but they're yours if you want"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Aw, man, me too, I'd kill for a burger right now","Rest when you can, eat when you can, that's all we can do"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Starving? So what? Not my problem!"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Here, I got half a candy bar, take it"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Hunger's a hell of a thing, {g:brother|sister}","We all feel it, rest if you can","Tough times, tough men"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Quit whining and move"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Come on, I've got a can of beans, we'll split it"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I sympathize, though I can offer little","A full stomach is a luxury I'd happily share, if I had one"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Here, I may have something in my bag, let me look"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"I know, I know, the hunger's the worst, worse than the fear sometimes","Sleep? What's sleep? I haven't since the walls fell"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't tell me you're hungry, I'm hungry too!"}},
