{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"I understand, we're all running on fumes","The courthouse has a food line, if you can make it"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Stay focused, rest when it's safe"}},
{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Sit down, I've got an energy bar in my pocket"}},
