{"PLAYER_TIRED_HUNGRY","reg=military|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I've got the cracker thing out of my ration pack - the cheese spread's gross, but it's yours - want it?"},false,{[1]="SHARE_FOOD"}},
